WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.621
What to take into the project.

2
00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:07.832
Your project is supervised fine-tuning with gold labels, so none of this lesson’s methods are required.

3
00:00:08.112 --> 00:00:09.883
What carries over is the reasoning.

4
00:00:10.163 --> 00:00:13.725
Choose the training signal that matches the feedback you can collect.

5
00:00:14.005 --> 00:00:23.264
Treat any model-generated training data, whether preferences or distilled outputs, as model output that needs checking before it becomes ground truth.

6
00:00:23.544 --> 00:00:28.963
Evaluate the trained model against human labels, never against the model that produced its data.

7
00:00:29.243 --> 00:00:37.435
And check the terms of every model whose outputs you train on, and the license of every model whose weights you build on, before you publish anything.
